0:51を参照。\nそして、川の中に沈んでいくポエット。それを魚たち(加藤さん一家 https://popnmusic.fandom.com/wiki/Poet/Gallery?file=Poet_9_Celt_Long.png )に発見される。\n4コマ目　びしょ濡れになったポエットが魚たちに浮き輪で助けられる。その時のポエットちゃんのセリフは、「クリア失敗…」\nhttps://m.youtube.com/watch?v=-thuzrJs9bg の0:56を参照\n\n3コマ目から4コマ目(溺れ〜救助)はこちらを参考にしてください。\nhttps://popnmusic.fandom.com/wiki/Poet/Gallery?file=Poet_SP_1P_Lose.gif\n\n他のセリフはご自由にどうぞ。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1565, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "イスナ🔞Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "footprintofisna", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fmisskey%2Fc077cb00-bd4d-473f-9c86-31f99669842c.png&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/7e163782-da06-4755-a57d-d6558bd8b30c.png", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 2633017, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "小摺ゆね", "screen_name": "CosRenai", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F62b885b8-125d-41e7-9052-056565e87c48.png?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/617ed078-b91e-476b-baa2-7162fbbc442e.webp", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 2697889, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "古江みみ@次は夏コミ予定", "screen_name": "mimi_furue", "avatar_url": "http